Well, as far as I recall, the lava fields where typically too large
to jump. Steeds, then, is a special case; you need a saddle and the
proficiency in the first place. From my experience, besides the two
obvious means that I mentioned, the cold-breathing monsters are,
while not granted, amongst the most practicable ways. With respect
to digging around crossing lava streams; the levels I saw had often
the level intersected, so there seemed no circumvention possible,
a single cut will hinder your progress in such cases. But I have to
admit that I haven't seen enough of those level to know how often
that will happen.

> I'm certain this is not a full list of possible actions and there are
