Well, in Nethack there's certainly always a chance for another one;
in this case I have problems seeing "myriads of ways" that are also
usable in more than specific game circumstances.

I am not sure, but probably such tools might be interesting to put
with a higher probability in specific (new) dungeon branches, as
has been proposed before. A "Cave of Cold" dungeon branch with all
sorts of "cold monsters", wands of cold, and the spell, with some
quest nemeses that are proficient in doing cold damage, movement
could be reduced there, food consumption increased in the cold.
Similar with other elementary properties (fire, electricity, etc.).

